&lt;h2&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp&#39;s Brand and Marketing Design team is behind the visual identity that reached over 4 million small businesses across 37 markets, and right now we&#39;re in the thick of rolling that new identity out across every channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team&#39;s focus is rolling that identity out across every channel, with motion as one of the main focuses: animated templates, a proper motion language, and consistent brand guidelines are a few of the many topics the new team member will support. Getting this right means faster, higher-quality animated content across campaigns, product, and employer brand, and a motion system that can scale as SumUp grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and adapt animated assets for campaigns, internal comms, events and day-to-day requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a library of reusable animated templates across formats like social, ads and web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organise and tag motion assets in Canto so the wider team can find and reuse them easily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the motion section of the Brand Standards Portal up to date as guidelines evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run lightweight quality checks on animated materials before they go live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute animated content for employer brand channels, including LinkedIn and social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in graphic design, visual communication or motion design, with hands-on experience in Adobe After Effects and Premiere Pro&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Figma, Photoshop and Illustrator for collaborating with brand and product designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of motion design fundamentals, including timing, easing, pacing, typography and composition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort switching between fast, reactive creative requests and longer-term projects like asset organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about brand strategy and a habit of asking why behind creative decisions, not just how&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office at Ostbahnhof&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Be part of an inclusive and collaborative environment where different perspectives are valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖️ 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days, pro-rated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Access health and well-being support through our Employee Assistance Programme, an Urban Sports Club subsidy, and fitness activities, including on-site gym access, yoga sessions, and team sports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚆 Benefit from subsidised public transport with the Deutschlandticket, offering unlimited travel on local and regional transport across Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🥗 Enjoy partially subsidised office lunches and weekly breakfast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Receive additional rewards through our employee referral programme when referring talent to join our team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance, and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📽️ Want to bring this post to life or create a LinkedIn post around it? Check out the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/sumup/Global-Employer-Brand-video-library-Empowering-Talent-Acquisition-partners-and-hiring-managers-194d3d97eb3c4eaca7ee2edff1a9d3fd&quot;&gt;Global Employer Brand video library&lt;/a&gt; for approved footage and clips.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let me know if you&#39;d like this shorter, longer, or with a different tone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll (Working Student)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;About the team&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, our People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll team is the engine behind a smooth and reliable employee experience. We manage the full employee lifecycle — from onboarding and contract changes through to offboarding — while supporting accurate and timely payroll across Southern Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In France, recurring operational work is growing across employee lifecycle administration, field sales hiring and payroll coordination. You’ll join a hands-on, detail-driven team where operational excellence and employee care go hand in hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Working Student position supporting the People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll team in France. You’ll take ownership of recurring administrative and payroll support tasks, help keep our data accurate and up to date, and make sure employees and managers get timely, clear support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great entry point into HR and payroll operations for someone who is organised, reliable, and eager to build real expertise in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Payroll support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to collect, and organise payroll input data ahead of monthly deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support follow-up with external payroll and benefits providers where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain accurate payroll records and flag missing information or discrepancies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HR administration &amp;amp; employee lifecycle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, update, and archive employment contracts and employee documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding, contract changes, and offboarding processes — ensuring data accuracy and completeness at every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with benefits administration where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employee support &amp;amp; ticket handling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to routine employee and manager queries via internal systems and email with clarity and care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage open tickets and follow up, escalating more complex cases when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data management &amp;amp; process improvement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update employee data in HR systems and Excel / Google Sheets trackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform regular data checks and keep Notion pages and internal documentation up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repetitive steps, data-quality issues, or bottlenecks in recurring workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest small process improvements that make day-to-day operations more efficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying or recently graduated in HR, Business Administration, Economics, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English — clear written and verbal communication is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a commitment to accuracy, especially with sensitive employee and payroll data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic Excel / Google Sheets skills and confidence working with structured data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and reliable — able to manage recurring tasks and meet regular deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable handling confidential information with discretion and good judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick to learn new tools and systems — we work across multiple HR platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with a hands-on, service-oriented attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Previous experience or studies in HR, payroll administration, or people operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Interest in payroll processes, HR systems, or process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Familiarity with AI tools such as ChatGPT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why SumUp?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎&amp;nbsp; Work with a truly global, multicultural team from our Barcelona office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈&amp;nbsp; Be part of a workplace that values diversity and inclusion, where every perspective is respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;❤️&amp;nbsp; Access our Employee Assistance Programme for mental health guidance and support when you need it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Revenue Analytics&lt;/strong&gt; team plays a key role in how SumUp supports its commercial growth — ensuring that our sales operations, incentives, and analytics processes run smoothly and efficiently. Working closely with Sales, Payroll, and Data teams, the Commissions function ensures our sales representatives are rewarded accurately and on time. You’ll join a small, collaborative team based in London that thrives on precision, process improvement, and cross-functional teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run weekly commission cycles across multiple markets, ensuring data accuracy and timely payouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve commission-related discrepancies, acting as the point of contact for sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate monthly commission data for Payroll, ensuring a smooth handover and zero recalculations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our Analytics and Sales Operations teams to identify process improvements and automate repetitive tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of automation and reporting tools, such as AI bots and ticketing systems, to make our workflows smarter and faster.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll Be Great for This Role If&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re currently studying or have a strong interest in &lt;strong&gt;sales operations&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;finance&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;data analytics&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have basic knowledge of Excel (e.g., pivot tables, formulas) and curiosity to learn SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re proactive and comfortable handling data with attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly and confidently with both technical and non-technical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy solving problems and thrive in a fast-paced, collaborative environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You Should Join SumUp (London) 🇬🇧&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our central London Bridge location, wrapped in historic charm and modern flair. This involves an office-first setup.&lt;br&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced.&lt;br&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave, plus bank holidays and special leaves&amp;nbsp; (pro rata).&lt;br&gt;🏥 Health matters: Vitality health cover, including optical and dental.&lt;br&gt;🚗 Life made easier: salary-sacrifice commuter benefits via Gogeta.&lt;br&gt;🛡 Peace of mind: life insurance from MetLife for 2× your salary.&lt;br&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we’re on a mission to empower small businesses around the world with simple, affordable tools to help them start, run, and grow. More than 4 million merchants across 36 markets trust us as their financial partner — and we’re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a global team of 3,000+ people from over 90 nationalities, united by curiosity, collaboration, and care. Our&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/1axu-TmW088?si=5NjHKNq5n-1GbXc2&quot;&gt; core values&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/XEH_nmJ9KZ4?si=pr6TdFl98FhpD5KG&quot;&gt; culture&lt;/a&gt; shape everything we do, fostering inclusion, learning, and belonging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, committed to building a safe, respectful, and diverse workplace where everyone can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Explore more about our culture on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers site&lt;/a&gt;, or follow us on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-semibold-pgl7 cui-body-normal-pxkh cui-body-highlight-bbub css-10dm8y e173j6r82&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-semibold-pgl7 cui-body-normal-pxkh cui-body-highlight-bbub css-10dm8y e173j6r82&quot;&gt;Employment type:&lt;/strong&gt; Working student, 20 hours/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;Take a look at where you&#39;ll be based: &lt;a class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh cui-anchor-pww3 cui-focus-visible-6pov css-k1irjw e17ev4ar0&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;watch the Berlin office tour&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp&#39;s Executive Recruiting team finds the critical leaders who help build a global company that is trusted by more than 4 million businesses. Because the best senior talent rarely applies through a job board, every search depends on solid market research, curiosity, and a bit of detective work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll learn this craft hands-on, working closely with our Executive Recruiter to track down candidates for some of SumUp&#39;s most important hires, often before they&#39;re even looking for a new role. It&#39;s a structured, supported way into Executive Recruiting and broader Talent Acquisition, built for someone who&#39;s curious about what makes a person the right fit for SumUp and a great leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and map candidates for senior and strategic leadership roles using LinkedIn, our internal database and other sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shadow the Executive Recruiter on live searches to see firsthand what makes a strong leadership candidate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep candidate records accurate and up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share clear, structured updates on search progress during weekly check-ins with hiring teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help test new sourcing channels and ideas alongside the Executive Recruiting team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about people and what makes someone the right fit for a role, shown through previous jobs, research projects, coursework, volunteer work, or self-directed learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persistence and attention to detail, with a track record of keeping structured, accurate records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage deadlines and multiple tasks in a professional or academic setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness to feedback and comfort picking up new tools and ways of working quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Any prior exposure to sourcing or CRM tools is a bonus, not a requirement. Full training will be provided.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office at Ostbahnhof&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Be part of an inclusive and collaborative environment where different perspectives are valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖️ 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days, pro-rated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Access health and well-being support through our Employee Assistance Programme, an Urban Sports Club subsidy, and fitness activities, including on-site gym access, yoga sessions, and team sports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚆 Benefit from subsidised public transport with the Deutschlandticket, offering unlimited travel on local and regional transport across Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🥗 Enjoy partially subsidised office lunches and weekly breakfast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Receive additional rewards through our employee referral programme when referring talents to join our team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 39 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 4,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Parloa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa’s mission is to make every customer conversation feel effortless for both customers and the companies serving them. As agentic AI accelerates, Parloans are shaping the foundation of a new era in customer experience — one where customer support is no longer transactions, but meaningful exchanges. It is not just a vision; Parloa has powered over ONE BILLION interactions between global enterprise brands and their customers, with companies like IKEA and Booking.com already deploying Parloa at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Founder’s Associate Intern&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll take on strategic problems that don’t yet have a home and turn them into tangible outcomes, fast. You’ll work directly with our Chief of Staff and the CEO Office team, and from day one you’ll own cross-functional projects wherever the business needs leverage most. High-bandwidth, high-visibility, built for people who thrive in ambiguity and operate with extreme ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Areas of ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Own CEO Office projects that cut across the company, end-to-end. You find what’s broken, work out why, build the plan, and drive it across teams until it’s done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in planning, executing, and monitoring various projects of high strategic importance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research and Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct research, analyze data, and generate insights to support decision-making processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist with our day-to-day operations to enhance efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree or higher in Business Management or related fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work from our Berlin HQ at least 5 times a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 years experience in fast-paced environments (e.g. Strategy Consulting, Venture Capital,&amp;nbsp; high-growth start-up)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneur at heart with a hands-on mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native, always trying out new tools and building the best ones into how you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational &amp;amp; prioritization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your recruiting process at Parloa:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruiter video call → Meet the Hiring Manager → Meet the Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Parloa?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re at the beginning of a new era in customer experience, one where AI doesn’t just respond, but understands, reasons, and takes action. We’re building agentic AI that enterprises trust with their most important customer moments: complex questions, high volumes, real stakes. When millions of people reach out to a brand, those interactions aren’t just support tickets; they’re defining experiences. We’re here to raise the standard: making every conversation seamless, intelligent, and genuinely helpful. If you care about shaping how businesses and customers connect at scale—and want your work to matter in real, everyday moments—this is where you do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Parloa, ownership isn’t a buzzword; it means being accountable for outcomes, not just tasks. We operate in a category that’s evolving fast, where the bar is high, and the problems are complex. We hire people who think in solutions, communicate with clarity, and follow through. People who are comfortable making decisions, taking responsibility, and raising the standard for themselves and those around them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve grown beyond the earliest startup phase, but we’ve kept the intensity: fast execution, direct feedback, and a strong expectation to contribute meaningfully from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by leading global investors like General Catalyst, EQT Ventures, and Altimeter Capital, we’re scaling with a clear ambition: to become the global category leader in enterprise-grade conversational AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/P4d-iyx7RQM&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is committed to upholding the highest data protection standards for our clients&#39; and employees&#39; data. All our employees are instrumental in ensuring the utmost care, GDPR, and ISO compliance, including ISO 27001, in handling sensitive information.&lt;/p&gt;
