&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Selected candidates will then receive an email invitation to&amp;nbsp;participate&amp;nbsp;in a case study, allowing you to&amp;nbsp;showcase&amp;nbsp;your experiences and&amp;nbsp;demonstrate&amp;nbsp;your business acumen.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Following submission and review of your case study, the next step would be an online assessment and virtual one on one interviews with various members of the Academy team, if selected.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;ABOUT POINT72&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Point72 is a leading global alternative investment firm led by Steven A. Cohen.&amp;nbsp;Building on&amp;nbsp;more than 30 years of investing experience, Point72 seeks to deliver superior returns for its investors through fundamental and systematic investing strategies across asset classes and geographies. We aim to attract and&amp;nbsp;retain&amp;nbsp;the industry’s brightest talent by cultivating an investor-led culture and committing to our people’s long-term growth.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;a firm that thrives on ideas, and&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;found that the Point72 Academy has provided us with diverse viewpoints and perspectives. We&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;offer support in&amp;nbsp;Academy Associates’&amp;nbsp;growth and development as analysts and portfolio managers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.point72.com/working-here&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;www.Point72.com/working-here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;There is no set application deadline for this position. Candidates are considered as they apply, until the program is at&amp;nbsp;capacity. We strongly encourage you to apply and fulfill all requirements as soon as you feel ready to begin the hiring process. Please&amp;nbsp;note,&amp;nbsp;you may only&amp;nbsp;submit&amp;nbsp;one application to the Academy program globally, so please be sure to apply to the region you are most interested in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;miss this opportunity to kickstart your career in the world of investing with Point72 Academy. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note that any use of&amp;nbsp;GenAI&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;strictly prohibited&amp;nbsp;when completing this application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Job Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity for students and researchers of advanced data modeling and statistical learning methods to apply these techniques to market prediction and systematic trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-process (validate, clean, normalize, reduce dimension) very large data sets for model estimation and event studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify features and relationships useful for the predictive modeling of market dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Desirable Candidates&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate, MS, or PhD candidates in finance, computer science, mathematics, physics, or other quantitative discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming in any of the following: C++, Java, C#, MATLAB, R, Python, or Perl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and quantitative skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest in financial markets and systematic trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise, and proactive communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to take ownership of his/her work, working both independently and within a small team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary is $120,000-$180,000 (USD) which will be prorated based on internship start and end date. Actual compensation offered to the successful candidate may vary from posted hiring range based upon geographic location, work experience, education, and/or skill level, among other things.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Job Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a small number of highly talented interns to assist in the development, optimization, and monitoring of our production trading platform and research infrastructure. Interns will work on small, highly collaborative teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Desirable Candidates&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate or graduate candidates in computer science or engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in Python, C++, C, or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serious interest in systems programming (e.g. Linux kernel development, compilers, embedded systems, networking, file systems, debuggers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of how userland programs run on Linux and interact with the kernel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some basic knowledge of Git, databases (e.g. MySQL), and web development frameworks is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise, and proactive communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to take ownership of his/her work, working both independently and within a small team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Maven Securities is a leading proprietary trading firm that uses sophisticated technology and quantitative analysis to trade global financial markets. We specialise in options and derivatives market making, where your skills can have a real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Maven, we believe exceptional careers are built deliberately. Our summer internship is designed for a small number of high-potential students each year, combining structured training with practical exposure. We don’t hire large classes expecting only a few to succeed; we invest in every individual who joins the programme.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you would like to be considered for our London Trader Summer Internship, applications will open on 7th September. We can only accept one application per candidate per recruitment cycle, so please ensure you apply to the role you are most interested in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programme details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programme dates:&lt;/strong&gt; 21st June – 20th August 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application deadline:&lt;/strong&gt; Tuesday 20th October 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must have the right to work in the region you are applying for at the time of application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be a penultimate-year undergraduate or master’s student&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must not have applied for any other Maven programmes in this cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a structured nine-week internship, giving you a practical introduction to options market making. The programme starts in our London office, with three weeks of interactive options theory classes led by one of our traders. You’ll then return to Amsterdam, quickly progressing into trading simulation and mock trading, helping you build the foundations you need to become a trader. You’ll also gain exposure to different desks through shadowing and project work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Throughout the internship, you’ll be assessed on your performance and development. Successful interns may be considered for our Graduate Trader Programme the following year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Build practical trading skills in our simulation environment, applying your learning to real market scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Use the same tools as our traders - or build your own - and observe the same trades being executed in the live market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Learn directly from traders across different desks through shadowing and regular interaction, with opportunities to ask questions and understand their day-to-day approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Take part in a dedicated Reading Week, working independently on a project and exploring an area of interest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How and what you will learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Build your foundations in options market making - we don’t expect prior knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Develop your understanding of options theory, pricing, probability and risk with Maven’s in-house trainers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Apply your knowledge through trading simulation, testing different strategies, learning from experience and building confidence as a trader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Develop your understanding of the wider market through macroeconomics and technical training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Progress through clear learning milestones, with ongoing feedback from the Trading and Emerging Talent teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Strong numeracy skills and a good understanding of probability and statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;A genuine interest in financial markets and a curiosity to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;A willingness to adopt and utilise emerging AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for someone who is&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An entrepreneurial thinker&lt;/strong&gt; who takes the initiative to generate ideas that further your learning and improve existing tools or systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A critical problem solver and decision-maker&lt;/strong&gt; who analyses situations and makes effective decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An agile learner&lt;/strong&gt; who quickly acquires knowledge, responds to feedback and adapts to new situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Able to synthesise information&lt;/strong&gt; and turn complex or conflicting inputs into clear, actionable insights and decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative and influential&lt;/strong&gt;, able to build trust, share what you have learned and work effectively with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results-focused and accountable&lt;/strong&gt;, comfortable taking ownership and making decisions in the face of uncertainty and with incomplete information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Maven?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dedicated in-house trainers:&lt;/strong&gt; Learn through a programme designed for the Summer Trader Internship and delivered by Maven’s traders and in-house experts, covering technical and professional skills, as well as how AI is integrated into our daily work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your career:&lt;/strong&gt; Learn by trying new things, making mistakes and developing quickly. We’ve had traders progress to head-of-desk roles within two and a half years of joining as graduates. If you perform well and are ready, you can progress quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven pathways:&lt;/strong&gt; Around a quarter of our workforce joined through an Emerging Talent Programme, including more than 50 of our current traders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported to succeed:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive regular feedback, structured reviews and day-to-day support, including a Maven buddy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We invest in you:&lt;/strong&gt; From the start of the internship, you’ll be immersed in a simulated trading environment and learn directly from traders. Throughout, you’ll gain practical insight into how our desks operate and have the opportunity to demonstrate your potential for the Graduate Trader Programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maven is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to building a diverse workforce and inclusive environment. We welcome applications from all candidates regardless of background or identity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits at Maven&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Intern, you’ll be eligible for benefits including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Regular social events where you can get to know us, from welcome dinners and team bowling to boat tours and end-of-programme celebrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Free breakfast and lunch served daily in the office, plus drinks and snacks throughout the day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Free accommodation in London within walking distance of our office, plus assistance with relocation or living costs to support your return to Amsterdam for the remainder of the programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Access to a state-of-the-art on-site gym&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Work in a forward-thinking environment where AI is integral to our strategy and daily operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As an Applied Science Intern, you will join a cross-functional team of engineers and applied scientists building AI-powered features within the Datadog platform. You will contribute to both existing and new products by improving machine learning models, developing new AI capabilities, and helping bring research into production. Working closely with engineering and product partners, you&#39;ll gain hands-on experience deploying AI systems at scale while strengthening your product mindset, collaboration, and communication skills. You&#39;ll also have opportunities to contribute to cutting-edge research that directly powers customer-facing features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions for AI use cases by researching and benchmarking state-of-the-art models to identify the best approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build highly scalable product features using generative AI, machine learning algorithms, and statistical techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development, deployment, monitoring, and maintenance of production AI models, services, and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore, analyze, and derive insights from the large-scale observability data flowing through Datadog systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in technical knowledge sharing by presenting recent academic research and investigating emerging model architectures to improve existing and future products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering and product teams to productionize AI solutions and deliver customer-facing features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will graduate in&lt;strong&gt; 2027 &lt;/strong&gt;with a degree in Machine Learning, Artificial Intelligence, Statistics, Computer Science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building machine learning models through coursework, research, internships, or personal projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong programming skills and are eager to learn new languages and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate complex technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong interest in artificial intelligence, machine learning, and data-driven product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available to complete a 6-month internship beginning in&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;February, March, April, May, or June 2027 (we are unable to accommodate internships starting at any other time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We know not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That’s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your experience, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on meaningful technical challenges alongside engineers across the globe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in mentorship and buddy programs designed to support learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join an in-person intern cohort, attend company social events, and engage with Datadog Community Guilds and employee resource groups throughout the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive relocation support and travel benefits where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy office perks including snacks, drinks, and catered lunches on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please ensure that you submit your CV/resume in English. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If possible, please apply using your personal email address instead of your university email address.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Students can sign up for a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/blog/datadog-github-student-developer-pack/&quot;&gt;free Datadog Pro account&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our platform and products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
