&lt;li&gt;Advanced quantitative, analytical and problem-solving skills and the ability to deploy those skills under time-sensitive situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient programming in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are self-motivated, enjoy challenges and significant responsibility, and thrive in fast-paced, competitive environments&lt;/li&gt;
