&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits at Maven&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern joining Maven, you’ll be eligible for a range of benefits, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular social events where you can get to know us, from welcome dinners and the Maven summer party to end-of-programme celebrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free daily breakfast and lunch in the office, as well as snacks and drinks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site gym access, with regular classes and in-office massages&lt;/li&gt;
