&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;After applicants pass an initial resume screening, an online programming test will be emailed to you via HackerRank. Upon review, we will reach out to arrange next steps. We are looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/div&gt;
