&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Currently pursuing a PhD in a quantitative discipline, such as physics, mathematics, computer science, engineering or a related technical field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evidence of creative, high-quality research relevant to your stage of study.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with at least one general-purpose programming language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong critical thinking and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear written and verbal communication skills, including experience presenting scientific work to others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to take initiative and work effectively as part of a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An interest in applying your academic expertise to practical challenges in industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Important notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PhD students must temporarily step away from their PhD studies to undertake this internship. We can therefore only accept applications from current PhD students who do not require a visa to study in the UK and who already have the right to work in the UK for the full internship duration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are unable to provide visa sponsorship or letters of support for sponsorship applications for this internship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
