&lt;li&gt;High degree of enthusiasm for the live event / event production industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fluency in German and English with excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Theater / Stage Management is a plus!&lt;/li&gt;
