&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Student, Fever Originals Central &amp;amp; Northern Europe (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;📍 Berlin | approx. 20 hours per week, flexible around your lecture schedule&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As part of the &lt;strong&gt;Fever Originals team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will use data and insights to create one-of-a-kind events and experiences that allow people to have unforgettable moments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a proactive and detail-oriented Working Student to support the Fever Originals Central Europe team in Berlin. Fever Originals builds and runs its own experiences. You will sit in the middle of that team and keep both the office and the projects moving. Part of your work will be recurring and dependable, part of it will be whatever landed on the team&#39;s desk this morning. If you like variety, real ownership and seeing how an experience goes from a spreadsheet to a queue outside the door, this is a good place to spend your working student years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
